{"id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-satisfaction.md","title":"项解释与满足","display":"df-satisfaction — 项解释与满足","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-satisfaction","aliases":["56-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — 项解释与满足","depends_on":["[[56-df-structure]]","[[56-df-assignment]]","[[56-df-formula]]","[[56-df-term]]"],"source_status":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note","verification_status":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — 项解释与满足"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3544e74f0e48d8ac\" href=\"?note=3544e74f0e48d8ac\" title=\"56-df-structure\">56-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"be37a8a17c1010ee\" href=\"?note=be37a8a17c1010ee\" title=\"56-df-assignment\">56-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c94545e8fa521ff\" href=\"?note=1c94545e8fa521ff\" title=\"56-df-formula\">56-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2dc1cdb8cd43b80e\" href=\"?note=2dc1cdb8cd43b80e\" title=\"56-df-term\">56-df-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)\">\\(L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)\">\\(\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)\\)</span>；项集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_L\\)</span> 与公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2dc1cdb8cd43b80e\" href=\"?note=2dc1cdb8cd43b80e\" title=\"56-df-term\">56-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1c94545e8fa521ff\" href=\"?note=1c94545e8fa521ff\" title=\"56-df-formula\">56-df-formula</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B=(B,K)\">\\(\\mathfrak B=(B,K)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Algebra}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K)\">\\(\\mathrm{Algebra}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3544e74f0e48d8ac\" href=\"?note=3544e74f0e48d8ac\" title=\"56-df-structure\">56-df-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in B^{\\mathcal V}\">\\(\\gamma\\in B^{\\mathcal V}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}\">\\(\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}\\)</span>。赋值更新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\">\\(\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"be37a8a17c1010ee\" href=\"?note=be37a8a17c1010ee\" title=\"56-df-assignment\">56-df-assignment</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F_L\">\\(f\\in F_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=\\mathrm{ar}_L(f)\">\\(k=\\mathrm{ar}_L(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^k\">\\((u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^k\\)</span>。关系分支中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\vec t\">\\(P,\\vec t\\)</span> 在断言内有界量化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t_i\">\\(\\vec t_i\\)</span> 为有限序列的分量；允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_L=\\varnothing\">\\(P_L=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>项解释在有限项树上递归，满足关系在有限公式树上递归并同时覆盖全部赋值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_L^2\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_L^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqModels}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{EqModels}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K,E)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,K)\\models E\">\\((B,K)\\models E\\)</span> 的参数域限于上述非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_L\">\\(\\Sigma_L\\)</span>-代数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}:\\mathrm{Term}_L\\times B^{\\mathcal V}\\to B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}:\\mathrm{Term}_L\\times B^{\\mathcal V}\\to B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}(x,\\gamma)\\coloneqq\\gamma(x),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}(f(u_1,\\ldots,u_k),\\gamma)\\coloneqq\nK(f)((\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}(u_i,\\gamma))_{i=1}^{k}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}(x,\\gamma)\\coloneqq\\gamma(x),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}(f(u_1,\\ldots,u_k),\\gamma)\\coloneqq\nK(f)((\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}(u_i,\\gamma))_{i=1}^{k}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t^{(B,K)}[\\gamma]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}(t,\\gamma),\\qquad\nt^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{val}_{A,I}(t,\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t^{(B,K)}[\\gamma]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}(t,\\gamma),\\qquad\nt^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{val}_{A,I}(t,\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(s\\doteq t)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow s^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(s\\doteq t)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow s^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall P\\in P_L\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models P(\\vec t_1,\\ldots,\\vec t_{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)})[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n((\\vec t_i)^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])_{i=1}^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\in J(P)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall P\\in P_L\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models P(\\vec t_1,\\ldots,\\vec t_{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)})[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n((\\vec t_i)^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])_{i=1}^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\in J(P)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\neg\\varphi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\neg\\varphi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\land(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\land(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[x\\mapsto a]]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[x\\mapsto a]]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[x\\mapsto a]]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[x\\mapsto a]]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqModels}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K,E)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Algebra}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K)\\land\n\\forall(s,t)\\in E\\;\\forall\\gamma\\in B^{\\mathcal V}\\;\n(s^{(B,K)}[\\gamma]=t^{(B,K)}[\\gamma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EqModels}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K,E)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Algebra}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K)\\land\n\\forall(s,t)\\in E\\;\\forall\\gamma\\in B^{\\mathcal V}\\;\n(s^{(B,K)}[\\gamma]=t^{(B,K)}[\\gamma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(B,K)\\models E\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EqModels}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K,E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(B,K)\\models E\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EqModels}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K,E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>项解释及等式模型对应原书 §2.5（印刷 pp43–44）与 §7.1（pp262–265）；关系和量词分支是辅助的一阶扩展。所有运算均按其元数解释；零元函数的输入为空元组。递归不再以一个未完的“当且仅当”统领无类型的编号公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"be37a8a17c1010ee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1c94545e8fa521ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"2dc1cdb8cd43b80e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"2dc1cdb8cd43b80e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$，$\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)$；项集 $\\mathrm{Term}_L$ 与公式集 $\\mathrm{Form}_L$ 分别见 [[56-df-term]]、[[56-df-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1c94545e8fa521ff","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$，$\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)$；项集 $\\mathrm{Term}_L$ 与公式集 $\\mathrm{Form}_L$ 分别见 [[56-df-term]]、[[56-df-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak B=(B,K)$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Algebra}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K)$，$\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)$，见 [[56-df-structure]]；$\\gamma\\in B^{\\mathcal V}$、$\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}$。赋值更新 $\\beta[x\\mapsto a]$ 见 [[56-df-assignment]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"be37a8a17c1010ee","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak B=(B,K)$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Algebra}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K)$，$\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)$，见 [[56-df-structure]]；$\\gamma\\in B^{\\mathcal V}$、$\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}$。赋值更新 $\\beta[x\\mapsto a]$ 见 [[56-df-assignment]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B=(B,K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Algebra}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in B^{\\mathcal V}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta[x\\mapsto a]","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F_L","display":false},{"tex":"k=\\mathrm{ar}_L(f)","display":false},{"tex":"(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^k","display":false},{"tex":"P,\\vec t","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t_i","display":false},{"tex":"P_L=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_L^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqModels}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K,E)","display":false},{"tex":"(B,K)\\models E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}:\\mathrm{Term}_L\\times B^{\\mathcal V}\\to B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}(x,\\gamma)\\coloneqq\\gamma(x),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}(f(u_1,\\ldots,u_k),\\gamma)\\coloneqq\nK(f)((\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}(u_i,\\gamma))_{i=1}^{k}).","display":true},{"tex":"t^{(B,K)}[\\gamma]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{val}_{B,K}(t,\\gamma),\\qquad\nt^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{val}_{A,I}(t,\\beta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\models(s\\doteq t)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow s^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta].","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall P\\in P_L\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models P(\\vec t_1,\\ldots,\\vec t_{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)})[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n((\\vec t_i)^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])_{i=1}^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\in J(P)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\neg\\varphi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\land(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[x\\mapsto a]]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[x\\mapsto a]]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqModels}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K,E)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Algebra}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K)\\land\n\\forall(s,t)\\in E\\;\\forall\\gamma\\in B^{\\mathcal V}\\;\n(s^{(B,K)}[\\gamma]=t^{(B,K)}[\\gamma]).","display":true},{"tex":"(B,K)\\models E\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EqModels}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K,E).","display":true}],"bytes":3645,"backlinks":[{"id":"3d7d3e1543060f95","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$E\\subseteq T^2$；$\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$ 见 [[56-df-equational-theory]]。$\\mathrm{Algebra}_\\Sigma(A,I)$、$\\mathrm{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A,I,E)$ 及 $u^{(A,I)}[\\beta]$ 见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]；赋值 $\\beta\\in A^V$。载体量词 $\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing$ 在集合论元语言中遍历非空集合；$I$ 显式遍历 $\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}$，使每个项解释均在合格代数上求值。本节点定义等式理论的语法—语义完备性质。"},{"id":"a0a8374d48d26bd5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$V$ 为固定变量集、$E\\subseteq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)^2$，$\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$。模型谓词和同态分别见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]、[[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]。$B$ 在集合论元语言中取遍非空集合，$J$ 取遍下式指定的全运算解释族；$B^0=\\{()\\}$。"},{"id":"a92e0473734a9033","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{Algebra}_\\Sigma(A,I)$，$Q\\subseteq A^2$，$s,t\\in T$；$u^{(A,I)}[\\beta]$ 为 [[56-df-satisfaction]] 的项解释，$\\beta\\in A^V$。"},{"id":"59f2769e44131c6a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"结构解释与满足关系见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]。下面 $A$ 在集合论元语言中取遍非空集合，$I,J$ 分别在该载体的函数解释族与关系解释族中量化；不构造所有结构组成的集合。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-322","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-satisfaction.md]]"},{"id":"6efb0e699c13a985","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$V$ 固定，$(G,I_G)=\\mathbf T_0(\\Sigma,V)$ 如 [[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]，并假设 $G\\ne\\varnothing$。初始性取 [[56-df-initial-algebra]]；目标 $\\Sigma$-代数的解释与赋值取 [[56-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"711a8fd18e306f8a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$、$\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(B,J)$，且 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)$，见 [[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]。$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$、$\\beta\\in A^V$、$t\\in T$；项解释见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"a7b1b75a0e18bc22","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$E\\subseteq T^2$；$\\to_{R/E}$ 为 [[56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations]] 的等价—一步—等价关系。$\\mathrm{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A,I,E)$ 采用 [[56-df-satisfaction]]，表示 I 解释下所有赋值满足 E。载体存在量词在集合论元语言中遍历非空集合 $A$；$I$ 遍历 $\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}$，$Q\\subseteq A^2$。模型谓词和 [[56-df-interpretation-order]] 的诱导解释序都在合格代数上求值；基本解释终止接口见 [[56-thm-interpretation-termination]]。"},{"id":"360c9afc4431285e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$V$ 为本书 $\\mathcal V$ 的实例。给定 $\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$、$\\beta\\in A^V$、$\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$、$t\\in T$。项解释见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]，替换应用见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。"},{"id":"b2200b3a7e14635b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-term-model]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,E,T,Q,G,Q_G,I_T,I_G$。记 $\\mathbf{TM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(T/Q,I_Q)$；仅在 $G\\ne\\varnothing$ 时记 $\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q})$。$\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}$ 见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]；商投影、替换解释及同态解释交换式见本文件直接依赖。"}],"outgoing":["3544e74f0e48d8ac","be37a8a17c1010ee","1c94545e8fa521ff","2dc1cdb8cd43b80e"]}